Very basic ques of Dp in Grids


1:
class Solution {
    int[][] t;
    private int solve(int i , int j , int m , int n){
        if(i == m-1 && j == n-1) return 1;

        if(t[i][j] != -1) return t[i][j];

        int right = 0;
        if(j+1 < n){
            right = solve(i , j+1 , m , n);
        }
        int down = 0;
        if(i+1 < m){
            down = solve(i+1 , j , m , n);
        }

        return t[i][j] = right + down;
    }
    public int uniquePaths(int m, int n) {

        t = new int[m][n];
        for(int i = 0; i<m; i++){
            Arrays.fill(t[i] , -1);
        }
        return solve(0 , 0 , m , n);
    }
}
T.C. -> O(m*n)
S.C. -> O(m*n) and O(m+n) recursion stack

